#: includes/settings.php
msgid "How often gather data"
msgstr "Koliko često prikupljati podatke"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If enabled, Evidence will gather data periodically. If disabled, you can only view data for specific host"
msgstr "Ako je omogućeno, Evidence će periodično prikupljati podatke. Ako je onemogućeno, možete pregledati podatke samo za određeni host"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Onemogućeno"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d hours"
msgstr "Svakih %d sati"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Every day"
msgstr "Svaki dan"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Every week"
msgstr "Svake sedmice"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When evidence will be started"
msgstr "Kada će Evidence biti pokrenut"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The Base Time for gather data to occur.  For example, if you use '12:00am' and you choose once per day, the action would begin at approximately midnight every day."
msgstr "Osnovno vrijeme za prikupljanje podataka. Na primjer, ako koristite '12:00am' i odaberete jednom dnevno, radnja će početi približno u ponoć svaki dan."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "How many changes store in database"
msgstr "Koliko promjena sačuvati u bazi podataka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If data gathering is enabled,  you can specify how many history (changed) records keep for each device"
msgstr "Ako je prikupljanje podataka omogućeno, možete navesti koliko historijskih (promijenjenih) zapisa sačuvati za svaki uređaj"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Without history"
msgstr "Bez historije"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d record"
msgstr "%d zapis"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d records"
msgstr "%d zapisa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Display information on device edit page"
msgstr "Prikaži informacije na stranici za uređivanje uređaja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If enabled, flowview will display evidence data on device edit page"
msgstr "Ako je omogućeno, flowview će prikazati Evidence podatke na stranici za uređivanje uređaja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send email on evidence information change"
msgstr "Pošalji email pri promjeni Evidence informacija"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If evidence find change, send email"
msgstr "Ako Evidence pronađe promjenu, pošalji email"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Excluded notification Host IDs"
msgstr "Izuzeti ID-ovi hostova za obavještenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Some devices report hw changes too often. You can exclude these host from email notification. Insert Host IDs, comma separator"
msgstr "Neki uređaji prečesto prijavljuju hardverske promjene. Možete izuzeti ove hostove iz email obavještenja. Unesite ID-ove hostova, odvojene zarezom"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Excluded notification device templates"
msgstr "Izuzeti šabloni uređaja za obavještenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Some devices types report hw changes too often. You can exclude these templates from email notification. Insert device templates IDs, comma separator"
msgstr "Neki tipovi uređaja prečesto prijavljuju hardverske promjene. Možete izuzeti ove šablone iz email obavještenja. Unesite ID-ove šablona uređaja, odvojene zarezom"
